- BERNSTEIN, Eduard. *Evolutionary Socialism*. 1899.
- LUXEMBURGO, Rosa. *Reforma ou Revolução?* 1899–1900.
- SASSOON, Donald. *One Hundred Years of Socialism*. 1996.
- PRZEWORSKI, Adam. *Capitalism and Social Democracy*. 1985.

